@startuml seq-target-reset
title sync() - Trap 4 target reset detection and recovery

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Consumer" as App
participant "runSync" as Sync
participant "probeTarget" as Probe
participant "ManagedCrud" as Crud
participant "pushRowToTarget" as Push
collections "Target A\n(Redis wiped between syncs)" as TgtA

note over TgtA
  Prior sync had propagated the propagation
  key + data-plane rows alpha + beta on A.
  Between syncs, the operator restarted A's
  Redis with --rdb-disabled OR cluster lost
  its state. A now reports clientsCount=0.
end note

App -> Sync : mgmt.http.sync()

== Phase A: probe detects the reset ==
Sync -> Probe : probeTarget(A)
Probe -> TgtA : GET /api/internal/hmac (signed)
TgtA --> Probe : 200 { clientsCount: 0, bootstrapLocked: true, ... }
Probe --> Sync : TargetHealth { reachable:true, clientsCount:0, bootstrapLocked:true }

Sync -> Crud : getDeliveryState(propRow.id, A)
Crud --> Sync : { state:"delivered", lastDeliveredAt:<prior sync> }

note over Sync
  targetWiped detected:
    health.reachable === true
    AND health.clientsCount === 0
    AND deliveryState.state === "delivered"
end note

== Flip every row that targets A back to "pending" for A ==
Sync -> Crud : for each dataRow targeting A:\n  setDeliveryState(row.id, A,\n    state:"pending", attemptCount:0)
Crud --> Sync : ok

== Re-push the propagation key via the bootstrap window ==
Sync -> Push : pushRowToTarget(propKey, A, hash,\n  purpose:"propagation-only", signer:undefined)
Push -> TgtA : POST /api/internal/hmac (unsigned, clientsCount=0 path)
TgtA --> Push : 201 { ok, operation:"create", clientId:propKey }
Sync -> Crud : setDeliveryState(propRow.id, A, "delivered")

== Phase C re-processes every flipped data-plane row for A ==
loop for each row whose delivery on A is now "pending"
  Sync -> Push : pushRowToTarget(row, A, fresh-UUID hash, signed)
  Push -> TgtA : POST /api/internal/hmac (signed by propKey)
  TgtA --> Push : 201
  Sync -> Crud : setDeliveryState(row.id, A, "delivered")
end

note over TgtA
  A is back to full nominal state:
  propagation key + every data-plane row
  that listed A in its targets.
  Other targets in the federation were
  not touched.
end note

Sync --> App : SyncSummary {\n  propagationKey: { pushedThisSync:true, targets:{delivered:[A]} },\n  rows: { propagated:N, ... }\n}

@enduml
